+class ProfileTurnLeaseToken:
+    """Synchronous ownership token for the profile-global kernel lock.
+
+    ``release`` is idempotent and identity-checked. The lock-file descriptor
+    remains open for the token's full lifetime; closing it (including on
+    process death) is what lets the operating system release the lock.
+    """
