+    lease wait can never outlive its enclosing turn. ``cancelled`` is polled
+    before and after each non-blocking lock attempt; a cancellation that races
+    a successful attempt releases the token before failing closed. A falsy
+    ``session_id`` returns ``None``; timeout and cancellation both fail closed.
